<node id="11119480" title="Re^2: Is there a problem with using barewords as filehandles ?" created="2020-07-18 03:20:42" updated="2020-07-18 03:20:42" _doctext_mode="strict"><type id="11">note</type>
<author id="830549">haukex</author>
<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;When (if) bareword filehandles are disallowed, will we still be able to do: &lt;c&gt;print STDERR 'ok';&lt;/c&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If [mod://bareword::filehandles] is anything to go by, then &lt;c&gt;STDIN&lt;/c&gt;, &lt;c&gt;STDOUT&lt;/c&gt;, &lt;c&gt;STDERR&lt;/c&gt;, &lt;c&gt;ARGV&lt;/c&gt;, &lt;c&gt;ARGVOUT&lt;/c&gt;, and &lt;c&gt;DATA&lt;/c&gt; would still be allowed.&lt;/p&gt;
</doctext>
